          <h3>10. Amendment of the Personal Data Protection Notice</h3>
          <p>This privacy notice it is part of the Company’s privacy protection policy where the company will review the privacy policy on a regular basis and may affect the privacy notice of the owner of the personal information. You can see the latest changes from the date at the bottom of the Privacy Notice via the Company’s website <a class="inline" href="https://www.hanagroup.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://www.hanagroup.com</a>.</p>
          <p>The Privacy Policy shall be effective from 17 May, 2022.</p>
